<title>USA: Encal sees increased cash flow.</title>
<headline>Encal sees increased cash flow.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Encal Energy Ltd expects cash flow per share to rise to C$0.77 from $0.64 in 1996, chief executive David Johnson told a conference Thursday.</p>
<p>He expects total cash flow to rise to C$80 million from C$66 million last year.</p>
